      "options": {
        "content": "### 正本と選択範囲\n\n- 実験: `experiments/${experiment_id}/`\n- run正本: `experiments/${experiment_id}/results/<tier>/`\n- task: `${task_id}`\n- fixture: `${fixture_id}`\n- 入力表現: `${input_representation}`\n\n記事の結果値は`run.json`と`outputs/score.json`から再集計し、この画面はOpenTelemetryの到達・相関と傾向の確認に使う。",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "正本とフィルター",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
